{
  "_about": "Catalogue of needs: kinds of fact a role or task can ask for. A need is documented when a verified fact matches its types and (if given) concepts; 'class:x' matches drug class x. 'answer' says how the screen answers it: latest = newest value per concept as of the as-of date; current_medication = latest medication list overrides older ones; trend = all values plus computed change; followup = recommendation plus 'nothing recorded after'; all = every match. 'applies_to_sex' makes a need 'not applicable' for the other sex. Owner: M1 (content) + E2 (matching).",

  "age":               {"label": "Age",                                  "types": ["history"],                 "concepts": ["age", "date_of_birth"],   "answer": "latest"},
  "weight_trend":      {"label": "Weight and BMI over time",             "types": ["measurement"],             "concepts": ["weight", "bmi", "height"], "answer": "trend", "trend_of": ["weight"]},
